<title>USA: TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Sybase Open tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>8-Chris Woodruff (U.S) beat Jean Philippe Fleurian (France)</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (England) beat Alejandro Hernandez (Mexico) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela)</p>
<p>6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Jim Grabb (U.S.) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Grant Doyle (Australia) beat Brian MacPhie (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>6-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Sebastien Lareau (Canada) 6-3</p>
<p>5-7 6-4</p>
<p>3-Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Mark Knowles (Bahamas) 6-4 4-6 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Justin Gimelstob (U.S.)  6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
